---
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import SocialFooter from '../components/SocialFooter.astro';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Mirror Context | 미러 컨텍스트"
  description="A public concept page about document-driven AI development workflows. Korean and English language toggle included."
>
  <Header current="home" />

  <main class="mx-auto max-w-[62rem]">
    <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-slate-500">
      <span data-lang="en">Concept page</span>
      <span data-lang="ko">컨셉 페이지</span>
    </p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">Mirror Context</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-xl leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
      <span data-lang="en">
        A minimal framework for AI-assisted software development where written artifacts stay synchronized with the codebase.
      </span>
      <span data-lang="ko">
        문서와 코드베이스를 항상 동기화해 두는 AI 지원 소프트웨어 개발을 위한 최소한의 프레임워크입니다.
      </span>
    </p>

    <p class="mt-8 text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">
      <span data-lang="en">
        Instead of relying on scattered chat history, Mirror Context treats project docs as a first-class system: every intent, decision, and implementation loop is reflected in a maintained document set.
      </span>
      <span data-lang="ko">
        흩어진 채팅 기록에 의존하지 않고, Mirror Context는 프로젝트 문서를 핵심 시스템으로 다룹니다. 모든 의도, 결정, 구현 루프를 관리되는 문서 집합에 반영합니다.
      </span>
    </p>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3">
      <a
        class="inline-flex items-center border border-slate-300 px-4 py-2.5 text-base font-medium text-slate-900"
        href="/mirror-context"
      >
        <span data-lang="en">Read the full article</span>
        <span data-lang="ko">전체 아티클 읽기</span>
      </a>
      <a
        class="inline-flex items-center border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-2.5 text-base font-medium text-slate-700"
        href="/raw/mirror-context.md"
        data-lang="en"
      >
        Open markdown source
      </a>
      <a
        class="inline-flex items-center border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 px-4 py-2.5 text-base font-medium text-slate-700"
        href="/raw/mirror-context.ko.md"
        data-lang="ko"
      >
        마크다운 원본 열기
      </a>
    </div>

    <section class="mt-16 border-t border-slate-200 pt-10" aria-labelledby="home-why-title">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-slate-500">
        <span data-lang="en">Why this pattern exists</span>
        <span data-lang="ko">왜 이 방식이 필요한가</span>
      </p>
      <h2 id="home-why-title" class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">
        <span data-lang="en">The bottleneck is context quality, not model quality.</span>
        <span data-lang="ko">병목은 모델 성능이 아니라 컨텍스트 품질입니다.</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">
            <span data-lang="en">Before</span>
            <span data-lang="ko">기존 방식</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-700">
            <span data-lang="en">Intent and constraints disappear inside long chat history.</span>
            <span data-lang="ko">의도와 제약이 긴 대화 기록 속에서 쉽게 사라집니다.</span>
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">
            <span data-lang="en">Mirror Context</span>
            <span data-lang="ko">Mirror Context</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-700">
            <span data-lang="en">Project memory is externalized as maintained, versioned documents.</span>
            <span data-lang="ko">프로젝트 기억을 관리되고 버전되는 문서로 외부화합니다.</span>
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="border border-slate-200 bg-slate-50 p-5">
          <h3 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">
            <span data-lang="en">Result</span>
            <span data-lang="ko">결과</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-700">
            <span data-lang="en">Fewer regressions, faster onboarding, and auditable decisions.</span>
            <span data-lang="ko">회귀 감소, 빠른 온보딩, 추적 가능한 의사결정을 얻습니다.</span>
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-14 border-t border-slate-200 pt-10" aria-labelledby="home-loop-title">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-slate-500">
        <span data-lang="en">Development loop</span>
        <span data-lang="ko">개발 루프</span>
      </p>
      <h2 id="home-loop-title" class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">
        <span data-lang="en">A repeatable five-step flow</span>
        <span data-lang="ko">반복 가능한 5단계 흐름</span>
      </h2>
      <ol class="mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
        <li class="border border-slate-200 px-4 py-4 text-sm text-slate-700">
          <span class="mr-2 font-semibold text-slate-900">1.</span>
          <span data-lang="en">Define intent in writing.</span>
          <span data-lang="ko">의도를 문서로 명확히 정의합니다.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="border border-slate-200 px-4 py-4 text-sm text-slate-700">
          <span class="mr-2 font-semibold text-slate-900">2.</span>
          <span data-lang="en">Explore code and gather evidence.</span>
          <span data-lang="ko">코드를 탐색하고 근거를 수집합니다.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="border border-slate-200 px-4 py-4 text-sm text-slate-700">
          <span class="mr-2 font-semibold text-slate-900">3.</span>
          <span data-lang="en">Propose a plan with explicit success criteria.</span>
          <span data-lang="ko">성공 기준이 있는 계획을 제시합니다.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="border border-slate-200 px-4 py-4 text-sm text-slate-700">
          <span class="mr-2 font-semibold text-slate-900">4.</span>
          <span data-lang="en">Implement narrowly and verify outputs.</span>
          <span data-lang="ko">작게 구현하고 결과를 검증합니다.</span>
        </li>
        <li class="border border-slate-200 px-4 py-4 text-sm text-slate-700 sm:col-span-2">
          <span class="mr-2 font-semibold text-slate-900">5.</span>
          <span data-lang="en">Reflect outcomes back into docs to keep context current.</span>
          <span data-lang="ko">결과를 문서에 반영해 컨텍스트를 최신 상태로 유지합니다.</span>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <section class="mt-14 border-t border-slate-200 pt-10" aria-labelledby="home-docs-title">
      <p class="text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-slate-500">
        <span data-lang="en">Document shapes</span>
        <span data-lang="ko">문서 구조</span>
      </p>
      <h2 id="home-docs-title" class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold leading-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-3xl">
        <span data-lang="en">Small files, clear roles</span>
        <span data-lang="ko">작은 문서, 명확한 역할</span>
      </h2>
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
        <article class="border border-slate-200 p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-slate-500">Intent Record</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-700">
            <span data-lang="en">Capture goals and explicit non-goals to prevent scope drift.</span>
            <span data-lang="ko">목표와 비목표를 명시해 범위 이탈을 막습니다.</span>
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="border border-slate-200 p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-slate-500">Decision Log</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-700">
            <span data-lang="en">Record tradeoffs and rejected options for future contributors.</span>
            <span data-lang="ko">트레이드오프와 기각된 대안을 남겨 다음 기여자를 돕습니다.</span>
          </p>
        </article>
        <article class="border border-slate-200 p-5">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-slate-500">Verification Checklist</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-7 text-slate-700">
            <span data-lang="en">Make diagnostics, typecheck, and build outcomes explicit.</span>
            <span data-lang="ko">진단, 타입체크, 빌드 결과를 명시적으로 기록합니다.</span>
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>

    </section>
  </main>

  <SocialFooter id="home-footer" />
</BaseLayout>
